          "iast": "asmin dehe budbuda upame",
          "devanagari": "अस्मिन् देहे बुद्बुद उपमे",
          "meaning": "for this, body, bubble, in similitude",
          "anvayaIndex": 5,
          "verseIndex": 12
        },
        {
          "itrans": "kaH kasya anushocyaH asti",
          "iast": "kaḥ kasya anuśocyaḥ asti",
          "devanagari": "कः कस्य अनुशोच्यः अस्ति",
          "meaning": "who, for whom, lamentable, is there.",
          "anvayaIndex": 6,
          "verseIndex": 7
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "4.21.4",
      "label": "4.21.4",
      "numbers": [
        4
      ],
      "devanagari": "अंगदः तु कुमारो अयम् द्रष्टव्यो जीव पुत्रया |\nआयत्या च विधेयानि समर्थानि अस्य चिन्तय",
      "iast": "aṃgadaḥ tu kumāro ayam draṣṭavyo jīva putrayā |\nāyatyā ca vidheyāni samarthāni asya cintaya",
      "translation": "\"You are the one with a living son, and you have to look after this young one Angada, and you have to think of the forthcoming activities for his well-being and for his performance of duty towards his father.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "jiiva putrayaa",
          "iast": "jīva putrayā",
          "devanagari": "जीव पुत्रया",
