          "iast": "paṇḍitena",
          "devanagari": "पण्डितेन",
          "meaning": "by prudent one",
          "anvayaIndex": 4,
          "verseIndex": 10
        },
        {
          "itrans": "iha laukikam shubham kartavyam hi",
          "iast": "iha laukikam śubham kartavyam hi",
          "devanagari": "इह लौकिकं शुभं कर्तव्यं हि",
          "meaning": "in here, worldly things, auspicious ones, are to be done, indeed.",
          "anvayaIndex": 5,
          "verseIndex": 7
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "4.21.6",
      "label": "4.21.6",
      "numbers": [
        6
      ],
      "devanagari": "यस्मिन् हरि सहस्राणि शतानि नियुतानि च |\nवर्तयन्ति कृत आशानि सो अयम् दिष्टांतम् आगतः",
      "iast": "yasmin hari sahasrāṇi śatāni niyutāni ca |\nvartayanti kṛta āśāni so ayam diṣṭāṃtam āgataḥ",
      "translation": "\"In whom hundreds and thousands of monkeys are harboured and astir, for they have reposed their confidence in him alone, that Vali has arrived at his end.",
