    {
      "id": "4.21.9",
      "label": "4.21.9",
      "numbers": [
        9
      ],
      "devanagari": "तौ इमौ शोक संतप्तौ शनैः प्रेरय भामिनि |\nत्वया परिगृहीतो अयम् अंगदः शास्तु मेदिनीम्",
      "iast": "tau imau śoka santaptau śanaiḥ preraya bhāmini |\ntvayā parigṛhīto ayam aṃgadaḥ śāstu medinīm",
      "translation": "\"Oh, lady, inspirit these two, Sugreeva and Angada, that are searing in grief, and if you acquiesce then this Angada will rule over the earth.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "bhaamini",
          "iast": "bhāmini",
          "devanagari": "भामिनि",
          "meaning": "oh, lady",
          "anvayaIndex": 0,
          "verseIndex": 6
        },
        {
          "itrans": "shoka samtaptau tau imau",
          "iast": "śoka samtaptau tau imau",
          "devanagari": "शोक सम्तप्तौ तौ इमौ",
          "meaning": "in grief, searing, these, two = Sugreeva, Angada",
